alid for a reward.\\n\\n__Mid-Contest Changelog__\\n\\n- **Challenges does not update AnchorStateRegistry for resolved games**\\nThe AnchorStateRegistry is never updated, causing proving costs to increase over time as games prove from a stale anchor, and third-party integrations reading the anchor as a finality signal see",
