ll vulnerability information or exploits.\\n  - Do not ask for any form of compensation from an affected party. You may compensate a disclosing party if you would like to after all known vulnerability details have been disclosed.\\n  - Do not disclose a bug or vulnerability on mailing lists, public boards, forums, s",
