n- [Decoding Puffer: The Future of Ethereum Restaking](https://medium.com/@puffer.fi/decoding-puffer-the-future-of-ethereum-restaking-28a8d7ee53da)\\n- [Ethereum Restaking Redefined: A Deep Dive with Puffer’s CTO](https://medium.com/@puffer.fi/ethereum-restaking-redefined-a-deep-dive-with-puffers-cto-at-devconnect-2023-11f30c7a38e9)",
