ex slope can be adjusted upward or downward based on utilization similar to kashi, however, a new continuous negative decay rate is applied every cycle when interest rates slope is elevated.\\n- Dynamic liquidation engine allows for more nuanced position management inside the system. Introduces a sliding scale o",
