ary pot size is $115,000\\n- Scoring described in the [competition scoring page](https://docs.cantina.xyz/cantina-docs/cantina-competitions/judging-process/scoring).\\n- Findings Severities described in detail on [our docs page](https://docs.cantina.xyz/cantina-docs/cantina-competitions/judging-process/f",
