rate with. Spend permissions are an early example of functionality that can be achieved within this new paradigm.\\n\\n\\n### Prize distribution and scoring\\n\\n- **Total Prize Pool:** \\\\$75,000\\n- **Primary Prize Pool:** \\\\$70,000\\n\\n- **The prize distribution has 2 possible triggers:**\\n    - If o",
