    "record_excerpt": "{\"id\": \"9c6e38e2-535e-47b2-83ef-29df91fbb774\", \"name\": \"Royco Dawn\", \"url\": \"https://cantina.xyz/competitions/9c6e38e2-535e-47b2-83ef-29df91fbb774\", \"company\": {\"id\": \"bb208d94-f2c4-44b6-a2e7-3c2c0469170d\", \"name\": \"Royco\", \"handle\": \"Royco\", \"logo\": \"https://imagedelivery.net/wtv4_V7VzVsxpAFaxzmpbw/2fc6ffc6-1f56-4d53-9610-3f6947a1be00/public\", \"website\": null, \"github\": null, \"twitter\": null}, \"timeframe\": {\"start\": \"2026-01-20T14:30:00Z\", \"end\": \"2026-01-27T14:30:00Z\"}, \"status\": \"complete\", \"currencyCode\": \"USDC\", \"totalRewardPot\": \"50000\", \"instructions\": \"\\nRoyco (v2) Dawn, is a perpetual risk tranching protocol. Dawn tranches on and off chain yield opportunities into senior and junior tranches. \\n\\nThe senior tranche is protected, at minimum, from a market defined drawdown percentage in the underlying investment by virtue of the junior tranche serving as first-loss capital. \\nIn exchange, the junior tranche receives a portion of senior yield in addition to its own yield, effectively making them leveraged. \\n\\nThe senior tranche yield split between the two tranches is continuously adapting to supply and demand signals from each tranche, allowing the market to price each opportunity in real time. \\n\\n### Prize distribution and scoring\\n\\n- **Total Prize Pool:** \\\\$50,000 \\n\\n- Only **High** severity findings will be rewarded in this competition. \\n- Please note that the competition will be judged by the Royco Team.\\n\\n\\n- Scoring described in the [competition scoring page](https://docs.cantina.xyz/cantina-docs/cantina-competitions/judging-process/scoring).\\n- Findings Severities described in detail on [our docs page](https://docs.cantina.xyz/cantina-docs/cantina-competitions/judging-process/finding-severity-criteria).\\n\\n\\n## Documentation\\n- Code is comprehensively commented. \\n    - The flow of contract interactions in Dawn is tranche -> kernel -> accountant -> YDM and back. \\n    - Here is a succinct description of the mechanism https://royco.gitbook.io/royco-dawn (some verbiage used here is different than that used in the code).\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n* **Repository:** https://github.com/roycoprotocol/royco-dawn/tree/cantina_competition\\n* **Commit:** `d5f9360cf",
