reinvested as additional liquidity — all in a single operation. This enables capital-efficient, hands-off yield optimization for borrowers.\\n\\n### Prize Distribution and Scoring\\n\\n- **Total Prize Pool:** \\\\$50,000\\n\\n- Only **High** and **Medium** severity findings will be rewarded in this ",
