verities described in detail on [our docs page](https://docs.cantina.xyz/cantina-docs/cantina-competitions/judging-process/finding-severity-criteria).\\n\\n\\n## Documentation\\n- [Technical Documentation](https://docs.royco.org/)\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n* **Repository:** [roycoprotocol/royco](https://github.com/roycopro",
