ed, please see the example from `test/Entrypoint.t.sol`.\\n- Subaccount is the concatenation of wallet address (20 bytes) + subaccount ID (12 bytes). One wallet can have many subaccounts.\\n\\n### Recorded Walkthough\\n- [Walkthrough](https://drive.google.com/file/d/13DDX1fdM103D-qF09cEZccFoxNc01kdv/view)\\",
