tic** — Single timelock for execution, with bypass for the optimistic path.\\n\\nMore information can be found in the repo [README.md](https://github.com/reserve-protocol/reserve-governor/blob/main/README.md).\\n\\n### Prize distribution and scoring\\n\\n- **Total Prize Pool:** $30,000\\n\\n- **The prize distr",
